<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Pentair raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Pentair raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>- Dain Bosworth said it has raised its rating on Pentair Inc to a buy from a hold.</p>
<p>- In a release dated November 12, analyst J. Blair Brumley said Pentair has come under selling pressure lately, and he sees this as a buying opportunity. He said his target price for Pentair is $31, which would bring it in line with other diversified manufacturers.</p>
<p>- Brumley said the overall outlook for next year for the company is generally good.</p>
<p>- Pentair shares traded 1/4 higher at 27-1/4.</p>
</text>
